  m_Text: 'Melee weapons can reflect bullets by simply attacking them. Be careful
    though, as you''re not the only one who can do this. Some enemies are smart enough
    to reflect your bullets.


    Melees can also cause Stun. When an enemy is stunned,
    they cannot shoot, move, or reflect. Enemies can stun players too. Sadly, you
    cannot stun bosses.'
